* Service Statement

** Pratt
Since starting at Pratt, I have been involved in faculty committees,
student groups, and in the faculty union. I have also been a faculty
advisor to ~30 students per semester, and ran workshops for the
Digital Storytelling Lab in AY 2025-2026 and 2026-2027. 

From this work, I will higlight the progress of the /Stacks/ Student
Journal, where I serve as Faculty Advisor. The student group consists
of students from previous iterations of my INFO 601: Foundations of
Information course, who have decided to come togeher to peer-review
and publish their papers from 601. They are in the process of
producing their first issue, which will be out in early spring 2027.

